  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for the integration of Vulnerable Neighborhoods</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Integracin de Barrios Vulnerables</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo es fortalecer las capacidades del Ministerio de Vivienda y Urbanismo de Chile para promover la integracin social y urbana de migrantes y comunidades receptoras presentes en barrios vulnerables.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to strengthen the capacities of the Ministry of Housing and Urbanism of Chile to promote the social and urban integration of migrants and recipient communities present in vulnerable neighborhoods</narrative>
  </description>
